<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101790" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχᾰδών</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχάδων</span></b>  (as in <i><span class="en">
			Arist.
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όνος</span>, ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>larva of the bee</i> or
				<i>wasp</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				554a29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				555a8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				624a8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>breeding-cell</i> of the larva, <i><span class="en">
				Theaet.
			</span></i> ap. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.147
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>honey-cell</i>, and in pl. <i>honeycomb</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				318.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				569.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				275
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				41.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				354.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; so also in sg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχαδόνα δεῖ πάντως φαγεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euthycl.
					1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> a throw of
			the dice, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
